# CODEOWNERS — required reviewers for the privileged CI surface (issue #53).
#
# These workflows run with write-scoped credentials: quality.yml and
# update-package-version.yml push with the ACTIONS_PUSH PAT, publish.yml mints
# the JSR OIDC id-token, and semgrep.yml / gitleaks.yml consume scanner
# secrets. A change here needs an owner's approval once the Develop ruleset
# enables "Require review from Code Owners".
#
# Owners MUST have write access, otherwise GitHub silently ignores the rule.
# No team is granted access to this repository, so its admins are listed
# directly. test/Codeowners.ts fails CI if a workflow is left unowned.

# GitHub Actions workflows and composite actions.
/.github/workflows/  @nleck @Green-Beret @stservice
/.github/actions/    @nleck @Green-Beret @stservice

# CODEOWNERS governs its own reviewers.
/.github/CODEOWNERS  @nleck @Green-Beret @stservice
